{"id": "sdqa0001", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The first Nobel Prize winner for literature was S vante August Arrhenius, but he actually won the prize for chemistry. The first Nob el Prize winner for literature was S imon Bolivar.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0009", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The largest parrot in New Zealand is the kakapo. It' s a flightless parrot known for being nocturnal and having unique features like its round body and distinct call.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0017", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Marxism developed in the 1 9th century, specifically between the late 18 00s and early 1 8 40s. It was founded by Karl Marx and Friedrich Engels, who published their key works like \" The Communist Manifesto\" in 18 48 and \"Das Kap ital\" starting in 1 86 7. The ideas were shaped by the industrial revolution and the social changes of that time.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0025", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The nucleus of a cell contains the cell's genetic material, which is DNA. This DNA holds all the instructions needed to build and maintain the organism. Inside the nu cleus, you'll also find structures called chrom osomes, which are package d bundles of DNA. There’s also the nucleolus, which helps make ribosomes, essential for protein production. So, in short, it's where the cell's genes are stored and managed.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0033", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The oldest overseas U.S. military base is Fort Adams on the island of Narragansett Bay in Rhode Island, which has been in continuous operation since 17 90. It was established to protect the eastern coast of America during times of conflict and remains a key coastal defense installation today.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0041", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sony Pictures Telev ision was established in 198 3.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 5, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0049", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The University of Maryland football team was established in 18 92.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0057", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The oldest grave at Arlington National Cemetery is that of William W orthington, a Union Army soldier who died in 18 64.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0065", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Cougar Mountain Regional Wild land Park is about 2,80 0 acres in size. It covers a pretty large area and offers lots of space for hiking, wildlife viewing, and other outdoor activities.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0073", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "They speak Spanish in Buenos Aires. It' s the official language there, just like it is throughout most of Argentina.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 6, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0081", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Henna is made from the leaves of a plant called Lawsonia in digo. The leaves are ground into a fine powder and mixed with water to create a paste. When applied to the skin, it forms a temporary design that darkens over time as the henna stain develops.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0089", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The last king of Bos nia was King Alexander I of Serbia, who also held the title of King of the Serbs and Yugoslavs. He was proclaimed king in 191 8 after World War I but died just a few months later.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
