{"id": "sdqa0153", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Yuma War lasted from December 18 47 to May 1 848. It was a conflict between the United States and Mexican forces in the region around Yu ma, Arizona, primarily involving border disputes and resistance to U.S. expansion.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 13, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0161", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Commonwealth of Independent States, or CIS, was formed on December 8, 1 99 1. It came into existence shortly after the dissolution of the Soviet Union, as a way for former Soviet republic s to maintain economic and political ties while pursuing independence.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0169", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The dollar bill was introduced in 17 9 2, when the United States government officially adopted it as legal tender.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0177", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The other species that belong to the Equi dae family include horses, donkeys, and zebras. These animals are all related because they share similar physical features like long legs, ho oves on their feet, and a body structure built for running fast.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 12, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "sdqa0185", "pool": "sdqa", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The Rhineland is a region in Western Europe. It stretches across parts of Germany, France, and Belgium, centered around the Rhine River, which gives it its name. In Germany, it includes areas like the Rhine Valley, known for its historic cities, castles, vineyards, and scenic landscape s. It ’s also famous for its culture, architecture, and wine production.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 22, "carrier_ended": null}
